<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said in brisk trading slaughter steers and heifers sold $1.00 to $1.50 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - mainly choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 68.50-70.00. Select 66.50-68.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 975-1200 lbs 68.00-69.75. Select 65.50-68.00.</p>
</text>
